---
description: Review attributed Vibestudio phone setup, Tendril, terminal operation or terminal-app receipts.
args:
  request: DeviceTerminalRequest
returns: DeviceTerminalReview
---
1. For phone call reviewPhone. For tendril call reviewTendril. For terminal call reviewTerminal. For terminal-app call reviewTerminalApp.
2. Return the chosen review unchanged. Cite supplied evidence IDs. Interpret only the observation and its immediate next condition. The active devices, sessions, transport and approvals stay under the caller's control.
